('node-9-28', 'phase-09-lesson-28-building-an-autograd-engine-v-loss-module', 'module-4', 28, 'Lesson 4.28: Building an Autograd Engine V: Loss Modules, Optimizers & GradFlow Validation', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 9.22, Lesson 9.27', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 9.22, Lesson 9.27 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 280, 10, 2310.0, 1400.0, '# Lesson 9.28: Building an Autograd Engine V: Loss Modules, Optimizers & GradFlow Validation

